{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Atoms / Landing column (2171:25782): one column of Two columns equal
  A stack of landing blocks. Settings: bracket (with its own 24px padding), sticky (desktop), the space between blocks, and padding
  for desktop and mobile, all on the Figma Spacing scale. See snippets/landing-column.liquid.
  Private: only Two columns equal uses it (as its static left and right column).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- capture content -%}{% content_for 'blocks' %}{%- endcapture -%}
{% render 'landing-column', content: content, settings: block.settings, attributes: block.shopify_attributes %}

